# SteamHangar Android app (app/) — WP 4b.1.
# Scoped to this directory; does not affect the rest of the monorepo.

# Local SDK path — machine-specific, NEVER committed (repo rule: secrets/
# local machine config stay out of the repo; see app/README.md for how to
# regenerate this file).
local.properties

# Gradle
.gradle/
build/
*/build/
gradle-app.setting

# Gradle wrapper jar IS committed on purpose (WP brief: "gradle wrapper
# (committed wrapper files; gradle-wrapper.jar is expected and fine)") — do
# not add gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar here.

# Android Studio / IntelliJ
.idea/
*.iml
.DS_Store
captures/
.externalNativeBuild/
.cxx/

# Local dev signing / secrets (WP 4b.9 release-signing work landed this
# WP; keep the pattern here so a keystore never lands in the repo by
# accident). Review fix (S3): *.jks/*.keystore alone missed every OTHER
# keystore format keytool can produce — `keytool -genkeypair` defaults to
# PKCS12 as of modern JDKs (no `-storetype` needed to get one), so an
# operator naming their store e.g. `steamhangar.p12` next to the project
# would otherwise be trackable. This is the one finding class that is
# unrecoverable after a push (the private key itself, not just a
# password), so the extensions below are covered even though nothing here
# uses them today.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
*.bks
keystore.properties
